      "lineNbr": 356,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-22T22:57:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Look, for example, preloadClasses() where classes from the bootclasspath is preloaded.\n\nIt reads the list of classes to preload and then use Class.forName() to actually load them. I don\u0027t see such mechanism here.",
      "parentUuid": "330aa418_0a99620a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 356,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 356,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "6abbb58c451be9c61b479270d022fa7a3d7078bb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
